aph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/b8d50cc13c195bb71127c7fc2f94253f.avif?t=1754866175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Riddledale is a volcanic island in the middle of the sea, located between the western and the eastern continents. Ancient ruins from an extinct civilization still cover the island but its fall remains unsolved. In more recent years, the town of Riddledale has grown to become a prime touristic destination and its new mining operations are rapidly putting back the forgotten island on the maps. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141850/extras/f881351c6f87dee710e14b1e7daa33d3.avif?t=1754866175\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Visit the official website to learn more about the game. Join the community and get a chance to participate in exclusive beta tests before release.</p>",
